{"productId": "e9e854b9-8e76-46d6-868a-a292cd5dfae9", "modelName": "Model 94 Short Rifle", "modelDescription": "A favorite of many hunters and shooters, the Short Rifle has always been fast to the shoulder, quick-swinging, lightweight and a pleasure to shoot. It was a favorite of the range rider who could snatch it from his saddle scabbard and fire faster than prairie lightning. The new Winchester Model 94 Short Rifle has a compact 20\" deeply-blued round barrel and a straight grip walnut stock. It has a rifle-style forearm, black grip cap, and a full-length magazine. It's drilled and tapped for scope mounts, and a hammer spur extension is included with the rifle. The sights are traditional with a semi-buckhorn rear and a Marble Arms gold bead at the muzzle. With the new Short Rifle Model 94, there's a lot of fun waiting in the saddle, in the field or at the range.", "manufacturerName": "Winchester Repeating Arms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "1bca6691-18e8-4b48-a8d7-739faf990722", "description": "Winchester Repeating Arms, Model 94 Short Rifle, Lever Action, 450 Marlin, 20\" Barrel, Brush Polish Blued, Right Hand, 7+1 ", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/2e38f1cb-2d94-4a3e-a882-173c2f33c336", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/7a9223de-89ba-4004-bf71-0dbe97edf9c1", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/614456ec-785c-4a3e-a20d-002f9b51194d"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "534174160", "upc": "048702004766", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "489958cc-0acf-432b-a36b-80107a101b7e", "valueName": "Blued"}, {"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "5b8eaa8b-2339-4bb7-b000-bcd02bbdcca4", "valueName": "450 Marlin"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", 